AI-assistance disclosure
------------------------

Many of the visual assets in this directory were produced with the help of
generative AI image tools, working from prompts, references, and revision
guidance authored and curated by the AIEvoPet Contributors. Hand-edited
post-processing (background removal, palette quantization, sprite
trimming, and selection between candidate variants) was applied before
the assets were committed.

Copyright treatment of purely AI-generated output varies by jurisdiction
— some jurisdictions (e.g., the United States Copyright Office's current
guidance) hold that material lacking sufficient human authorship is not
eligible for copyright; others recognize copyright in AI-assisted works
where meaningful human creative input is present.

To the extent that copyright subsists in any of these assets under the
law applicable to your use, that copyright is licensed to you under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License described below.
Where copyright does not subsist, the assets are practically usable
without restriction; we still ask, as a matter of community courtesy,
that you preserve the attribution string at the bottom of this file when
redistributing or building on them.

